{"id":"4b426f126126a9e1","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-principal-filter.md","title":"度偏序的主滤集","display":"df-principal-filter — 度偏序的主滤集","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-principal-filter","aliases":["20-df-principal-filter"],"display":"df-principal-filter — 度偏序的主滤集","chapter":"6","section":"6.4","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§6.4 跳跃上锥；结构记号的本地定义","source_pdf_pages":[173],"source_printed_pages":[139],"depends_on":["[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-principal-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-principal-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-principal-filter — 度偏序的主滤集"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§6.4 跳跃上锥；结构记号的本地定义"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>173</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>139</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}:=\\{\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D:\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}:=\\{\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D:\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里“滤集”只指向上锥；本目录不附加未存在的全局 meet 运算，也不声称该结构是格。</p>\n<p>来源：§6.4 跳跃上锥；结构记号的本地定义；印刷页 139；PDF 第 173 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}principal\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\ge\\mathbf a}:=\\{\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal D:\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf b\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":998,"backlinks":[{"id":"d9de3791ae9122ae","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-principal-filter]]。"}],"outgoing":["e888141c21b61ce5"]}